            <title>[IGNITE-9352] Web Console: Investigate how correctly use package-lock.json</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9352</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We need to investigate how correctly use package-lock.json and &quot;^&quot; symbol in package.json.&lt;/p&gt;

